cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ADNI structural connectome pipeline
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ethiraj
    given-names: Sabeesh
repository-code: "https://github.com/p22ai003-tech/adni-structural-connectome"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end pipeline from diffusion and T1 MRI to AAL3 structural
  connectomes, and from those matrices to the statistical and machine-learning
  results they support. The imaging side runs MRtrix3, FSL and ANTs under a
  Snakemake workflow with an explicit input contract, a per-run source content
  lock and deterministic per-subject seeding. The analysis side is a 37-stage
  graph covering network measures, length-resolved connectivity, exception
  analysis and a residualised machine-learning model.
keywords:
  - structural connectome
  - diffusion MRI
  - tractography
  - Alzheimer's disease
  - ADNI
  - AAL3
  - reproducible pipeline
license: MIT

references:
  - type: software
    title: MRtrix3
    notes: Denoising, FOD estimation, tractography and connectome assembly.
    authors:
      - family-names: Tournier
        given-names: J.-Donald
    repository-code: "https://github.com/MRtrix3/mrtrix3"
  - type: software
    title: FSL
    notes: >-
      Eddy-current and motion correction, and BBR registration. Free for
      academic use only; see the FSL licence.
    repository-code: "https://fsl.fmrib.ox.ac.uk/fsl/"
  - type: software
    title: ANTs
    notes: Nonlinear registration between the template and native T1 space.
    repository-code: "https://github.com/ANTsX/ANTs"
  - type: software
    title: dcm2niix
    notes: DICOM to NIfTI conversion and acquisition metadata.
    repository-code: "https://github.com/rordenlab/dcm2niix"
